ary Argument Signers Form","x":758,"y":169,"w":611,"h":39},{"text":"No more than five signatures shall appear with any argument. If more than five signatures","x":255,"y":229,"w":1583,"h":40},{"text":"are submitted, the first five listed shall be printed. Names and titles listed will be printed in","x":254,"y":275,"w":1578,"h":40},{"text":"the order that they are listed below. Place a checkmark in the author column if the signer is","x":253,"y":321,"w":1607,"h":42},{"text":"the author of the argument. A signer can only list one title. Honorifics such as M.D., Dr.,","x":253,"y":367,"w":1554,"h":42},{"text":"Esquire, etc. with a name are not accepted.","x":255,"y":415,"w":761,"h":41},{"text":"If the signers are part of a bona fide association, there is no requirement that they be","x":255,"y":484,"w":1485,"h":42},{"text":"eligible to vote on the measure. However, for each such signing individual, the title under","x":253,"y":530,"w":1571,"h":43},{"text":"the signer's name must list the name of that bona fide association and may include their","x":253,"y":576,"w":1545,"h":43},{"text":"position within that association.","x":254,"y":625,"w":543,"h":40},{"text":"By signing below, the undersigned state that they have read the argument and believe it not","x":254,"y":692,"w":1612,"h":44},{"text":"Author","x":1928,"y":168,"w":133,"h":30},{"text":"Pronouns:","x":1917,"y":1071,"w":178,"h":30},{"text":"He/His:","x":1917,"y":1129,"w":128,"h":31},{"text":"She/Her:","x":1916,"y":1176,"w":154,"h":31},{"text":"The /Them:","x":1915,"y":1222,"w":210,"h":31},{"text":"Pronouns:","x":1917,"y":1476,"w":177,"h":30},{"text":"He/His:","x":1917,"y":1534,"w":128,"h":31},{"text":"She/Her:","x":1916,"y":1579,"w":154,"h":31},{"text":"They/Them:","x":1915,"y":1625,"w":211,"h":39},{"text":"Pronouns:","x":1917,"y":1881,"w":178,"h":30},{"text":"He/His:","x":1917,"y":1938,"w":128,"h":31},{"text":"She/Her:","x":1916,"y":1984,"w":154,"h":32},{"text":"The [Them:","x":1915,"y":2031,"w":210,"h":31},{"text"